{
  "id": "6a9617170f0581236e9253b5",
  "title": "ワルプルギスの廻天 etc",
  "created": 1788221210,
  "updated": 1788231541,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a9617170f0581236e9253b5",
      "text": "ワルプルギスの廻天 etc",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788221210,
      "updated": 1788221288
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9617a70000000000b5ade8",
      "text": "[劇場版 魔法少女まどか☆マギカ〈ワルプルギスの廻天〉]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788221353,
      "updated": 1788221353
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9617690000000000b5ade1",
      "text": "\t上映開始日：[2026/08/28]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788221290,
      "updated": 1788221354
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9617870000000000b5ade2",
      "text": "\tネタバレ解禁日：[2026/09/12]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788221320,
      "updated": 1788221355
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9619bb0000000000b5adfe",
      "text": "\t\t解禁日以降は[SNS]上でネタバレ・考察が流れてくる可能性があり",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788221884,
      "updated": 1788221982
    },
    {
      "id": "6a961a320000000000b5ae00",
      "text": "\t\tネタバレ無しの感想がSNS上にあるが、賛否が分かれている",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788222003,
      "updated": 1788231541
    },
    {
      "id": "6a961b0d0000000000b5ae02",
      "text": "\t\t\t他人の感想は気にせずに自身が気になったら視聴することがオススメ",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788222222,
      "updated": 1788222258
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96212c0000000000b5ae24",
      "text": "\t本編冒頭は[2026/09/30]まで[公式サイト https://www.madoka-magica.com/wr/]で視聴可能",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788223790,
      "updated": 1788223929
    },
    {
      "id": "6a961fb00000000000b5ae1c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788223409,
      "updated": 1788223617
    },
    {
      "id": "6a961b850000000000b5ae03",
      "text": "[hr.icon]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788222342,
      "updated": 1788222351
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9617ab0000000000b5ade9",
      "text": "[* 事前に観たほうがいい作品]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788221356,
      "updated": 1788222339
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9617be0000000000b5adea",
      "text": "\t① [魔法少女まどか☆マギカ]（アニメ本編）",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788221375,
      "updated": 1788221520
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9617db0000000000b5aded",
      "text": "\t② [劇場版 魔法少女まどか☆マギカ 前編 始まりの物語]（アニメ再編集）",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788221404,
      "updated": 1788221523
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9617c40000000000b5adeb",
      "text": "\t③ [劇場版 魔法少女まどか☆マギカ 後編 永遠の物語]（アニメ再編集）",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788221381,
      "updated": 1788221529
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9618350000000000b5adef",
      "text": "\t④ [劇場版「魔法少女まどか☆マギカ ［新編］叛逆の物語」]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788221494,
      "updated": 1788221536
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9618810000000000b5adf6",
      "text": "\t上記のうち、以下の組み合わせ",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788221570,
      "updated": 1788221611
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9618610000000000b5adf2",
      "text": "\t\t① ＋ ④",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788221538,
      "updated": 1788221614
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9618640000000000b5adf3",
      "text": "\t\t② ＋ ③ ＋ ④",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788221541,
      "updated": 1788221616
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9618f60000000000b5adfa",
      "text": "\t① と ④ は[ハノカゲ]氏による[コミカライズ]もありどっちもアニメに忠実な内容のためオススメ",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788221687,
      "updated": 1788223218
    },
    {
      "id": "6a961bb90000000000e71a2a",
      "text": "\t 今回の映画もコミカライズが9月に発売されるらしい",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1788222394,
      "updated": 1788222406
    },
    {
      "id": "6a961f390000000000b5ae1a",
      "text": "\t \t第1巻：[2026/09/18]に発売",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788223290,
      "updated": 1788223317
    },
    {
      "id": "6a961eaa0000000000b5ae15",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788223148,
      "updated": 1788223148
    },
    {
      "id": "6a961b930000000000b5ae05",
      "text": "[hr.icon]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788222356,
      "updated": 1788222367
    },
    {
      "id": "6a961c0d0000000000b5ae07",
      "text": "派生作",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788222478,
      "updated": 1788222485
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96187b0000000000b5adf5",
      "text": " [魔法少女まどか☆マギカ Magia Exedra]でアニメ本編と[叛逆の物語]のストーリーの追体験可能",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788221564,
      "updated": 1788222489
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9618be0000000000b5adf7",
      "text": " \tアニメ本編では描かれてないシーンもあるが影響はない",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788221631,
      "updated": 1788222489
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9619090000000000b5adfb",
      "text": " [マギアレコード]・[まどドラ]等の派生作は触れていなくても直接影響はない",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788221706,
      "updated": 1788222489
    },
    {
      "id": "6a961eaf0000000000b5ae16",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788223152,
      "updated": 1788223153
    },
    {
      "id": "6a961bfe0000000000b5ae06",
      "text": "[hr.icon]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788222463,
      "updated": 1788223141
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96186f0000000000b5adf4",
      "text": "映画グッズ",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788221552,
      "updated": 1788223135
    },
    {
      "id": "6a961c1a0000000000b5ae08",
      "text": "\t[物販]（[劇場グッズ]）は売り切れ報告をSNSで散見する",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788222491,
      "updated": 1788222560
    },
    {
      "id": "6a961c600000000000b5ae0a",
      "text": "\t[来場者特典]は公開記念と週替りに分かれている",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788222561,
      "updated": 1788222639
    },
    {
      "id": "6a961cb20000000000b5ae0b",
      "text": "\t\t公開記念（特製色紙）：8月のうちに配布終了の報告あり、再配布を待つことになる",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788222643,
      "updated": 1788222774
    },
    {
      "id": "6a961d3a0000000000b5ae0d",
      "text": "\t\tミニ色紙風カード：週替りに貰えるキャラが変わる",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788222779,
      "updated": 1788222808
    },
    {
      "id": "6a961d910000000000b5ae0f",
      "text": "\t\t\t1週目：[鹿目まどか]、[美樹さやか]、[巴マミ]＆[百江なぎさ]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788222866,
      "updated": 1788222913
    },
    {
      "id": "6a961e580000000000b5ae13",
      "text": "\t\t\t\t8月のうちに配布終了報告多数",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788223065,
      "updated": 1788223071
    },
    {
      "id": "6a961dc60000000000b5ae10",
      "text": "\t\t\t2週目：[暁美ほむら]、[佐倉杏子]、新キャラ2人",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788222919,
      "updated": 1788223062
    },
    {
      "id": "6a961e560000000000b5ae11",
      "text": "\t\t\t\t[2026/09/04]配布開始",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788223063,
      "updated": 1788223111
    },
    {
      "id": "6a961a240000000000b5adff",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788221989,
      "updated": 1788223157
    },
    {
      "id": "6a961eba0000000000b5ae19",
      "text": "[ワルプルギスの廻天]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788223163,
      "updated": 1788228543
    },
    {
      "id": "6a961eb40000000000b5ae18",
      "text": "[まどマギ]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788223158,
      "updated": 1788223160
    }
  ]
}